Package: bios667.2026.materials
Title: BIOS 667 (2026) Reference Lectures, Homework, and Quizzes
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Dependency manifest for rendering the BIOS 667 2026 course materials
    (Fitzmaurice, Laird & Ware 2011). Every R package used by any lecture deck,
    homework, or quiz is listed under Imports. Render targets: R 4.5.1, Quarto >= 1.5.
    Install everything with: Rscript 2026/setup.R  (or see that script).
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    broom,
    broom.mixed,
    clubSandwich,
    dplyr,
    emmeans,
    geepack,
    ggplot2,
    glmmTMB,
    kableExtra,
    knitr,
    lme4,
    lmerTest,
    lmtest,
    MASS,
    mice,
    multgee,
    nlme,
    nnet,
    patchwork,
    pbkrtest,
    plm,
    pROC,
    pscl,
    purrr,
    reshape2,
    ResourceSelection,
    RLRsim,
    rmarkdown,
